              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwairirira, omukulu ow'abaisirukale yaayenda okumanha ensonga yeene Abayudaaya ye bavunaana Paulo. Kyeyava amusibulula, era yaalagira Bakabona Abakulu n'abatyama mu lwekobaano boonaboona okwesoloza. Yaatwala Paulo, yaamwemereza mu maiso gaibwe.",
          "type": "text",
